Thorsten (sano-de), a sanoTTS voice by Ampixa

sanoTTS's de-thorsten-1p57m, 1.57M parameters, distilled from Piper's de_DE-thorsten-medium, trained on CC0
recordings (Thorsten-Voice, https://github.com/thorstenMueller/Thorsten-Voice). Its weights are under the GPL-3.0
beside this file (Ampixa, https://huggingface.co/ampixa/sanoTTS). The source of its weights, of sanoTTS's runtime
and of the espeak-ng it reads phonemes with is in patai_node_xavier's voices-sources release:
https://github.com/patrickwasp/patai_node_xavier/releases/tag/voices-sources.
